From: LR-Vensuki <260785366+LR-Vensuki@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:12:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add a Hysteria2 client

A hop-0 client for apernet's Hysteria2: one QUIC connection per server,
authenticated with the HTTP/3 POST to /auth (status 233), and one
bidirectional stream per TCP connection (0x401 request, status reply).
Optional Salamander obfuscation wraps the UDP socket. A dead connection
is noticed when a new stream gets no datagram back and is replaced once.
UDP relaying is not implemented.
